  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Halve the cherry tomatoes. Sear them with the olive oil and butter in a deep frying pan for 2-3 minutes."
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the crushed garlic and Israeli couscous and stir."
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the cream, water, basil, oregano and spices and stir for 5-7 minutes, until the couscous is cooked (if it looks like it needs more liquid, add another quarter cup of water)."
    },
    {
      "text": "Slice the mozzarella and lay it on top. Stir through and dig in."
